{"text": "Today, however, Dorothy and Toto were not playing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Uncle Henry sat on the doorstep and looked worriedly at the sky, which was even grayer than usual. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Dorothy stood in the door with Toto in her arms and looked at the sky, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From the far north came a low wail of the wind, and the long grass bowed in waves. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then they heard a sharp whistling in the air from the south. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly Uncle Henry stood up and called to his wife, There is a cyclone coming, Em. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he ran toward the sheds where the cows and horses were kept. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Aunt Em dropped her work and came to the door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One look told her that the danger was very close. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Quick, Dorothy, she screamed, Run for the cellar.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "o", "d", "a", "y", ",", " ", "h", "o", "w", "e", "v", "e", "r", ",", " ", "D", "o", "r", "o", "t", "h", "y", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "T", "o", "t", "o", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "p", "l", "a", "y", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "U", "n", "c", "l", "e", " ", "H", "e", "n", "r", "y", " ", "s", "a", "t", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", "s", "t", "e", "p", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "w", "o", "r", "r", "i", "e", "d", "l", "y", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "k", "y", ",", " ", "w", "h", "i", "c", "h", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "g", "r", "a", "y", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "a", "n", " ", "u", "s", "u", "a", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "D", "o", "r", "o", "t", "h", "y", " ", "s", "t", "o", "o", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "